{
  "_why": "The figures the presentation publishes, copied out of keynote/build/scenarios.json so the page and the talk cannot drift apart, plus everything a stranger needs to check them: the exact file selection, the procedure that turns it into one digest, and the per-file hashes. site/analytics/check-evidence.py re-does it over the network.",
